&lt;h2 id=&#34;install&#34;&gt;Install
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;desktop--macos-windows-linux&#34;&gt;Desktop — macOS, Windows, Linux
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://onorca.dev/download&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Download from onOrca.dev&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Or grab a build directly: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/stablyai/orca/releases/latest/download/orca-macos-arm64.dmg&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;macOS Apple Silicon&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/stablyai/orca/releases/latest/download/orca-macos-x64.dmg&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;macOS Intel&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/stablyai/orca/releases/latest/download/orca-windows-setup.exe&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Windows (.exe)&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/stablyai/orca/releases/latest/download/orca-linux.AppImage&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Linux AppImage&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/stablyai/orca/releases/latest&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;All builds&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Running &lt;code&gt;orca serve&lt;/code&gt; on a headless Linux server? See the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;docs/reference/headless-linux-server.md&#34; &gt;headless Linux server guide&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Or via a package manager:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# macOS (Homebrew)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;brew install --cask stablyai/orca/orca
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Arch Linux (AUR) — or stably-orca-git to build from source&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;yay -S stably-orca-bin
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;mobile-companion--ios-android&#34;&gt;Mobile Companion — iOS, Android
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pair with your desktop app to monitor and steer your agents from your phone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;iOS:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://apps.apple.com/us/app/orca-ide/id6766130217&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Download on the App Store&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://testflight.apple.com/join/YjeGMQBA&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;join TestFlight&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Android:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/stablyai/orca/releases/download/mobile-android-v0.0.42/app-release.apk&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Download APK 0.0.42&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;community--support&#34;&gt;Community &amp;amp; Support
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discord:&lt;/strong&gt; Join the community on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/fzjDKHxv8Q&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Discord&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Twitter / X:&lt;/strong&gt; Follow &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://x.com/orca_build&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;@orca_build&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; for updates and announcements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WeChat:&lt;/strong&gt; Scan to join the Orca community WeChat group 7.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;docs/assets/wechat-qr-group7.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;WeChat group 7 QR code for the Orca community&#34; width=&#34;160&#34; /&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feedback &amp;amp; Ideas:&lt;/strong&gt; We ship fast. Missing something? &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/stablyai/orca/issues&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Request a new feature&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt; See the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.onorca.dev/docs/telemetry&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;privacy &amp;amp; telemetry docs&lt;/a&gt; for what anonymous usage data Orca collects and how to opt out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Show Support:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/stablyai/orca&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Star&lt;/a&gt; this repo to follow along with our daily ships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;developing&#34;&gt;Developing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Want to contribute or run locally? See our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;.github/CONTRIBUTING.md&#34; &gt;CONTRIBUTING.md&lt;/a&gt; guide.&lt;/p&gt;
